er  staff  430 Nov 13 19:37 invocation-metadata.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 13 19:37 locks-and-fencing-v1\n---STEER---\ncat: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/steer.md: No such file or directory\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Exit code: 1"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b 2>&1; echo \\\"---STEER---\\\"; cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/steer.md 2>&1\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595034045,"end":1794595034659}}}}
