indingsBySeverity\\\": {\\n    \\\"P0\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"P1\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"P2\\\": 0\\n  },\\n  \\\"openFindingsCount\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"resolvedFindingsCount\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"convergenceScore\\\": 0.0\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-findings-registry.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595445221,"end":1794595461400}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595461404,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d6395f6c001G3tUAbU442lZ6n","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d6380ab6001EHJ8AMmnWXklAK","type":"tool","id":"call_e8abf9eac61044d5a40e13b0","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - hook-confirm-3b\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - hook-confirm-3b\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder; review scope is commit `860610d783` and the two source files it changed plus their tests).\n- Lineage: `hook-confirm-3b`, session `fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey`, generation 1, lineage mode `new`.\n- Operator focus: confirm the pass-three fixes in commit `860610d783`; the doctor hook check is reviewed first and deepest, the no-edit pattern once.\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability.\n- Success criteria: every finding carries file:line and a concrete input the executor ran; no finding rests on inference alone.\n\n## 2. NON-GOALS\n\n- No code changes: the review target is read-only.\n- No re-litigation of pass-one and pass-two findings that are already closed; only the pass-three diff and its two source files are in scope.\n- No holdout prompt text: `holdout-prompts.jsonl` is never opened.\n- No repository tooling beyond the two named single test files and the hook check CLI.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness\n- [ ] D2 Security\n- [ ] D3 Traceability\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 6. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- `maxIterations` = 3 or convergence (`newFindingsRatio` below 0.10) at the end of an iteration, whichever comes first.\n- A confirmed active P0 stops the verdict at FAIL regardless of convergence.\n- Three consecutive iteration errors would stop the loop; none are expected.\n\n## 7. SCOPE FILES\n\n| Area | Path |\n|------|------|\n| doctor-docs | `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs` |\n| doctor-docs | `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs` |\n| advisor-runtime | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` |\n| advisor-runtime | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` |\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 8A. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- [None yet -- populated from each iteration's Ruled Out section]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: `hook-wiring-check.cjs` node-flag reading (`nodeFlagSkipsScript`, `runsNodeOnMarker`) against the driver of `DR3-P1-001`\n- Reason: initialization; the hook fix is the first and deepest subject of this lineage\n- Rotation status: none\n- Required evidence: concrete `--root` settings probes for attached and spaced node flags\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs:226-237` (new `nodeFlagSkipsScript`), `:270-280` (`runsNodeOnMarker`), `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:289` (`NO_EDIT_REQUEST`), `:293-295` (`isNoEditRequest`), callers `runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:677,881` and `runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:150`.\n- Behavior claims: an attached node flag value (`-e1`, `--eval=1`, `--print=1`) must not read as a launch of the hook script; an attached preload (`-r./preload.cjs`) must still read as a launch; `make no changes to <surface>` inside a change request must not read as a no-edit request.\n- Reuse and conventions: review doctrine from `sk-code-review/references/review-core.md`; severity P0/P1/P2 only; every finding needs `file:line` and a concrete input run.\n- Review risks and gaps: the pass-three commit's own suite claims (184 files, 1798 passed) are not re-run in full here; the two named single test files are the only suites run. The `node -` non-launch path is pre-existing, not introduced by this commit.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no runtime mirror in this diff |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no playbook surface in this diff |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T18:42:04Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - hook-confirm-3b\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - hook-confirm-3b\\n\\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\\n\\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder; review scope is commit `860610d783` and the two source files it changed plus their tests).\\n- Lineage: `hook-confirm-3b`, session `fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey`, generation 1, linea