{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595792798,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63e8f7b001tC3ncVWk0eP8OP","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d63e7f450014flT8MsY1XZTkg","type":"tool","id":"call_b2059771497d4719b0dbc3a4","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8A. WHAT FAILED\n- Relying on the commit's suite claim as evidence: the dispatch permits only the two named single test files, so the claim was treated as unverified prose and the CLI probes carried the proof instead (iteration 1).\n- Trusting a green guard suite as evidence that a predicate change is safe: the suite passed 26/26 while a genuine no-edit prompt was misrouted, because no row exercises `make no changes to <object>` as a no-edit request (iteration 2).","oldString":"## 8A. WHAT FAILED\n- Relying on the commit's suite claim as evidence: the dispatch permits only the two named single test files, so the claim was treated as unverified prose and the CLI probes carried the proof instead (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -59,8 +59,9 @@\n - Reading the flag grammar from node's own behaviour (`node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option`) instead of inferring it from the flag tables (iteration 1).\n \n ## 8A. WHAT FAILED\n - Relying on the commit's suite claim as evidence: the dispatch permits only the two named single test files, so the claim was treated as unverified prose and the CLI probes carried the proof instead (iteration 1).\n+- Trusting a green guard suite as evidence that a predicate change is safe: the suite passed 26/26 while a genuine no-edit prompt was misrouted, because no row exercises `make no changes to <object>` as a no-edit request (iteration 2).\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n ## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n ### \"The `/^-[rC]/` early return swallows a real no-run short flag\": ruled out by reading node's option grammar — `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as their value, so any later letter is a value, not a flag. `node -rc /dev/null` exits with `bad option: -rc`, which is the false-`ok` case folded into P2 finding 1. -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 8A. WHAT FAILED\\n- Relying on the commit's suite claim as evidence: the dispatch permits only the two named single test files, so the claim was treated as unverified prose and the CLI probes carried the proof instead (iteration 1).\\n- Trusting a green guard suite as evidence that a predicate change is safe: the suite passed 26/26 while a genuine no-edit prompt was misrouted, because no row exercises `make no changes to <object>` as a no-edit request (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\