s/hook-wiring-check.cjs --root <probe>` distinguishes the fix from a regression in one run, and the paired `printf '' | node - <script>` probe proves what node actually executes rather than what the reader assumes (iteration 1).\n - Reading the flag grammar from node's own behaviour (`node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option`) instead of inferring it from the flag tables (iteration 1).\n+- Running the same prompt through the pre-commit module extracted with `git show 860610d783^:...` and the current module: the before/after delta for a predicate change is measured, not asserted (iteration 2).\n \n ## 8A. WHAT FAILED\n - Relying on the commit's suite claim as evidence: the dispatch permits only the two named single test files, so the claim was treated as unverified prose and the CLI probes carried the proof instead (iteration 1).\n - Trusting a green guard suite as evidence that a predicate change is safe: the suite passed 26/26 while a genuine no-edit prompt was misrouted, because no row exercises `make no changes to <object>` as a no-edit request (iteration 2).\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Reading the flag grammar from node's own behaviour (`node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option`) instead of inferring it from the flag tables (iteration 1).\\n- Running the same prompt through the pre-commit module extracted with `git show 860610d783^:...` and the current module: the before/after delta for a predicate change is measured, not asserted (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Reading the flag grammar from node's own behaviour (`node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option`) instead of inferring it from the flag tables (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595788618,"end":1794595792802}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595792809,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63e9dd9001muZhv8kpNlvQQe","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d63e7f450014flT8MsY1XZTkg","type":"tool","id":"call_53ebc0c6a24b4a2ca359090e","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: maintainability (then traceability)\n- Focus area: the two named test files' coverage of the changed lines, the commit's own claims, and whether the two P2s stay advisory at synthesis\n- Reason: correctness is covered on both halves; the remaining question is whether the tests would have caught the P1\n- Rotation status: correctness rotates out\n- Required evidence: both named single test files run green, and the exact test-table gap cited by line","oldString":"## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness. - Focus area: the other half of commit `860610d783` — `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` and `isNoEditRequest` in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:289-295`, plus its callers in `runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:677,881` and `runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:150`. - Reason: the lineage must check the no-edit fix once; iteration 1 covered the hook half only. - Rotation status: none. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: the hook half is productive but saturated at the depth the operator asked for; do not re-enter it except to re-confirm the P2. - Required evidence: concrete predicate outputs for real no-edit and scope-limited change prompts, and the downstream gate each output changes.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/