/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs` | correctness | 1 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | partial |\n | `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs` | correctness | 1 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | partial |\n-| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n-| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n+| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | correctness | 2 | 0 P0, 1 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n+| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | correctness | 2 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | partial |\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | correctness | 2 | 0 P0, 1 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | correctness | 2 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | partial |\",\"oldString\":\"| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595800906,"end":1794595805509}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595805512,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63ecce3001XLo13MO7icl3jd","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d63eae2a001VRRD1QfwQWKaZo","type":"tool","id":"call_fcbe175a02af47fb81f982ba","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- \"The `/^-[rC]/` early return hides a real no-run short flag\": `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as a value, so a later letter is a value, not a flag (iteration 1, evidence: `node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option: -rc`).\n- \"The no-edit fix breaks the case it targeted\": both commit-added rows and `make no changes to its public api` return `false` (iteration 2, evidence: `command-attach.ts:289` and the predicate run in `iterations/iteration-002.md`).\n- \"Another alternative in `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` catches `make no changes to any file, just report what you find`\": all nine alternatives were enumerated against the prompt and none match (iteration 2).\n- \"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).","oldString":"- \"The `/^-[rC]/` early return hides a real no-run short flag\": `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as a value, so a later letter is a value, not a flag (iteration 1, evidence: `node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option: -rc`).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -112,8 +112,11 @@\n ## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n \n - \"The hook fix reports a plausible working hook command as hook-missing\": eight launch-shaped probes still return `ok`, including `node -r./preload.cjs <marker>` and `node --no-warnings <marker>` (iteration 1, evidence: `hook-wiring-check.cjs:231-237` and the probe table in `iterations/iteration-001.md`).\n - \"The `/^-[rC]/` early return hides a real no-run short flag\": `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as a value, so a later letter is a value, not a flag (iteration 1, evidence: `node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option: -rc`).\n+- \"The no-edit fix breaks the case it targeted\": both commit-added rows and `make no changes to its public api` return `false` (iteration 2, evidence: `command-attach.ts:289` and the predicate run in `iterations/iteration-002.md`).\n+- \"Another alternative in `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` catches `make no changes to any file, just report what you find`\": all nine alternatives were enumerated against the prompt and none match (iteration 2).\n+- \"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n - Dimension: maintainability (then traceability)\n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- \\\"The `/^-[rC]/` early return hides a real no-run short flag\\\": `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as a value, so a later letter is a value, not a flag (iteration 1, evidence: `node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option: -rc`).\\n- \\\"The no-edit fix breaks the case it targeted\\\": both commit-added rows and `make no changes to its public api` return `false` (iteration 2, evidence: `command-attach.ts:289` and the predicate run in `iterations/iteration-002.md`).\\n- \\\"Another alternative in `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` catches `make no changes to any file, just report what you find`\\\": all nine alternatives were enumerated against the prompt and none match (iteration 2).\\n- \\\"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\\\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- \\\"The `/^-[rC]/` early return hides a real no-run short flag\\\": `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as a value, so a later letter is a value, not a flag (iteration 1, evidence: `node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option: -rc`).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595802339,"end":1794595805512}}}}
