{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595824322,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63ef19a002imGrNM0yuEh5oQ","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d63edd1b0019EEV00ZWGTvr1D","type":"tool","id":"call_b1fbcfbe33a243f9a8c97b2a","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b && EVENT_FILE=\"$(mktemp \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-review-iteration.XXXXXX\")\" && cat <<'DEEP_LOOP_STATE_RECORD' > \"$EVENT_FILE\"\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"correctness\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:283-295\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:326-345\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:675-690\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:877-886\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:147-160\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:30-77\"],\"findingsCount\":2,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":2,\"P2\":1},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":1},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"HC3B-P1-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"The 'make no changes' lookahead is over-broad: a genuine no-edit request that names its object loses the guard\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:289\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness-regression\",\"scopeProof\":\"Changed line in a declared-scope file; attachCommand at command-attach.ts:335 and both scorer callers consume the same predicate, so the regression reaches every no-edit gate.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"attachCommand hub-command gate\",\"readOnlyRouteAllowed fusion.ts:677\",\"commandMeaningEligible fusion.ts:881\",\"isReadOnlyExplainer text.ts:150\"],\"description\":\"The added (?! (?:to|in)\\\\b) makes the shared predicate false for every 'make no changes to <object>' sentence, including genuine no-edit requests, so a mutating command is offered where the pre-commit module withheld it.\",\"case\":\"prompt 'make no changes to any file, just report what you find': post-fix isNoEditRequest=false and attachCommand='/create:agent'; pre-fix isNoEditRequest=true and attachCommand=undefined\",\"claim\":\"The added negative lookahead disables the shared no-edit gate for genuine object-bearing no-edit requests, so a mutating hub command is offered where it was withheld before the commit.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"command-attach.ts:289\",\"command-attach.ts:335\",\"fusion.ts:677\",\"fusion.ts:881\",\"text.ts:150\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Enumerated every other NO_EDIT_REQUEST alternative against the failing prompt; none matches. Read all three callers for a second check; none adds one. Ran the pre-commit module to confirm the guard fired before the change.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The change may intend every 'make no changes to X' to be a scope limit. Rejected: the predicate contract is wording that rules out a change, and NOEDIT4 treats bare 'make no changes' as that wording. Only a change verb elsewhere distinguishes the readings, and the predicate cannot see one.\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to P2 if the gate contract is amended to exclude every object-bearing form, or a caller is shown to re-add a change-verb check.\",\"disposition\":\"active\"},{\"id\":\"HC3B-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The lookahead's word list is too narrow: an adverb or a different preposition keeps the old false no-edit reading\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:289\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness-incomplete-fix\",\"scopeProof\":\"Same changed line; the input is a change request of the same shape as the two rows the commit added.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"attachCommand hub-command gate\",\"scorer no-edit gates\"],\"description\":\"The exclusion covers only a directly following 'to' or 'in', so 'make no changes whatsoever to ...' still matches inside a change request and withholds the command; the AR3-P2-001 failure mode remains reachable.\",\"case\":\"prompt 'refactor the parser and make no changes whatsoever to its public api': isNoEditRequest=true and attachCommand=undefined, identical to the pre-fix module\",\"disposition\":\"active\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"summary\":{\"required\":2,\"executed\":2,\"pass\":1,\"partial\":1,\"fail\":0,\"blocked\":0,\"notApplicable\":0,\"gatingFailures\":0},\"results\":[{\"protocol\":\"spec_code\",\"level\":\"core\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"evidence\":\"the named wording now keeps its command (make no changes to its public api -> false), but the same sentence's other half fails for genuine no-edit wording (P1)\"},{\"protocol\":\"skill_agent\",\"level\":\"overlay\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":\"attachCommand gate at command-attach.ts:335 consumes the shared predicate; no drift\"}]},\"newFindingsRatio\":0.86,\"noveltyJustification\":\"New weighted findings 6 (P1=5, P2=1) against a run total of 7 including iteration 1's P2; the no-edit half was unreviewed before this iteration.\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T18:48:53Z\",\"durationMs\":228000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"file-command-attach\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"command-attach.ts\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"finding-HC3B-P1-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"object-bearing no-edit loses the guard\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"edge-dim-covers-command-attach\",\"source\":\"dim-correctness\",\"target\":\"file-command-attach\",\"relation\":\"COVERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"edge-finding-in-command-attach\",\"source\":\"finding-HC3B-P1-001\",\"target\":\"file-command-attach\",\"relation\":\"IN_FILE\"}]}\nDEEP_LOOP_STATE_RECORD\nnode .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory \"$L\" --event-json \"$EVENT_FILE\"; STATUS=$?; rm -f \"$EVENT_FILE\"; echo \"GATEWAY_EXIT=$STATUS\"; exit \"$STATUS\""},"output":"{\"ok\":true,\"receipt\":{\"ledger_id\":\"deep-review-ledger\",\"sequence\":3,\"event_id\":\"event-088e7188-c2b8-4c6b-a6b7-4acbd7091f50\",\"event_type\":\"deep-review.ledger.iteration-recorded\",\"event_version\":1,\"stream_id\":\"deep-review-ledger\",\"stream_sequence\":3,\"committed_at\":\"2026-11-13T18:50:24.070Z\",\"canonicalEventHash\":\"354af5190f215c1213758a0d9ca30a0164bd2b9b8e5a442db3797f36823b8d70\",\"recordHash\":\"a2fdeb3f531cd58e33f3480cf3c0a8ecd50951b13b7d3d99d33d9ab8a20482b5\",\"authorizationRef\":{\"audit_ledger_id\":\"deep-review-audit-ledger\",\"audit_sequence\":4,\"audit_record_hash\":\"4c1090757949a1b8e95e19a8c172f0fea53e8cd9b12cddc5249e50f5223055f2\",\"decision_id\":\"decision-d59cc3d4-4469-4c54-ae56-c18083cf4678\",\"decision_digest\":\"2a935eccfd33f309298a5e24cce3886b5a90e85f8f75c9609ef3d9d756ab44ab\",\"request_digest\":\"0336daab04b24cdf3ca974d815b6fd601f488ac968f559d33d21a8934ebe11f0\",\"policy_digest\":\"883e5d03486b26c23ecdb48a893d8b0db0d8e2e7125e0847705bfd4a2b1a4500\",\"authority_epoch\":1,\"fence_token\":3},\"ledgerId\":\"deep-review-ledger\",\"eventId\":\"event-088e7188-c2b8-4c6b-a6b7-4acbd7091f50\",\"eventType\":\"deep-review.ledger.iteration-recorded\",\"eventVersion\":1,\"streamId\":\"deep-review-ledger\",\"streamSequence\":3,\"committedAt\":\"2026-11-13T18:50:24.070Z\"},\"projectionRefreshed\":true,\"projectionError\":null}\nGATEWAY_EXIT=0\n","title":"shell