ommit module withheld it.\\\",\\\"case\\\":\\\"prompt 'make no changes to any file, just report what you find': post-fix isNoEditRequest=false and attachCommand='/create:agent'; pre-fix isNoEditRequest=true and attachCommand=undefined\\\",\\\"claim\\\":\\\"The added negative lookahead disables the shared no-edit gate for genuine object-bearing no-edit requests, so a mutating hub command is offered where it was withheld before the commit.\\\",\\\"evidenceRefs\\\":[\\\"command-attach.ts:289\\\",\\\"command-attach.ts:335\\\",\\\"fusion.ts:677\\\",\\\"fusion.ts:881\\\",\\\"text.ts:150\\\"],\\\"counterevidenceSought\\\":\\\"Enumerated every other NO_EDIT_REQUEST alternative against the failing prompt; none matches. Read all three callers for a second check; none adds one. Ran the pre-commit module to confirm the guard fired before the change.\\\",\\\"alternativeExplanation\\\":\\\"The change may intend every 'make no changes to X' to be a scope limit. Rejected: the predicate contract is wording that rules out a change, and NOEDIT4 treats bare 'make no changes' as that wording. Only a change verb elsewhere distinguishes the readings, and the predicate cannot see one.\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"downgradeTrigger\\\":\\\"Downgrade to P2 if the gate contract is amended to exclude every object-bearing form, or a caller is shown to re-add a change-verb check.\\\",\\\"disposition\\\":\\\"active\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"HC3B-P2-002\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"finalSeverity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The lookahead's word list is too narrow: an adverb or a different preposition keeps the old false no-edit reading\\\",\\\"file\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:289\\\",\\\"findingClass\\\":\\\"correctness-incomplete-fix\\\",\\\"scopeProof\\\":\\\"Same changed line; the input is a change request of the same shape as the two rows the commit added.\\\",\\\"affectedSurfaceHints\\\":[\\\"attachCommand hub-command gate\\\",\\\"scorer no-edit gates\\\"],\\\"description\\\":\\\"The exclusion covers only a directly following 'to' or 'in', so 'make no changes whatsoever to ...' still matches inside a change request and withholds the command; the AR3-P2-001 failure mode remains reachable.\\\",\\\"case\\\":\\\"prompt 'refactor the parser and make no changes whatsoever to its public api': isNoEditRequest=true and attachCommand=undefined, identical to the pre-fix module\\\",\\\"disposition\\\":\\\"active\\\"}],\\\"traceabilityChecks\\\":{\\\"summary\\\":{\\\"required\\\":2,\\\"executed\\\":2,\\\"pass\\\":1,\\\"partial\\\":1,\\\"fail\\\":0,\\\"blocked\\\":0,\\\"notApplicable\\\":0,\\\"gatingFailures\\\":0},\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"spec_code\\\",\\\"level\\\":\\\"core\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"partial\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"the named wording now keeps its command (make no changes to its public api -> false), but the same sentence's other half fails for genuine no-edit wording (P1)\\\"},{\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"skill_agent\\\",\\\"level\\\":\\\"overlay\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"attachCommand gate at command-attach.ts:335 consumes the shared predicate; no drift\\\"}]},\\\"newFindingsRatio\\\":0.86,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"New weighted findings 6 (P1=5, P2=1) against a run total of 7 including iteration 1's P2; the no-edit half was unreviewed before this iteration.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey\\\",\\\"generation\\\":1,\\\"lineageMode\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-13T18:48:53Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":228000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"file-command-attach\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FILE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"command-attach.ts\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"finding-HC3B-P1-001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"object-bearing no-edit loses the guard\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"edge-dim-covers-command-attach\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"dim-