{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595868473,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d63fcc47001CW7FXCtdiDahyu","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d63f741b001gLdyrKi2rIyINj","type":"tool","id":"call_02bcddd0b6db4e7fb07d1daa","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \"post_dispatch_validate\" -A 60 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | rg -n \"exactly|one|delta|iteration|schema_mismatch|command\" | head -30"},"output":"1:1658:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n2:1659-            - \"Nested CLI dispatch from a lineage is a route violation, not a slow path: a codex lineage that runs this script spawns codex inside its own sandbox, where the child cannot initialize and every iteration fails. The script refuses that case before any spawn and before any dispatch receipt is written, exiting RECURSION_GUARD_EXIT_CODE; that refusal is a route error to fix, never a redispatchable executor failure.\"\n5:1662-            - \"codex exec reads the iteration prompt from stdin via the trailing '-' (input: promptBody); '-c model_reasoning_effort=' maps reasoning depth, default medium; '-c service_tier=' forwarded when configured\"\n6:1663-            - \"--sandbox workspace-write is required so the iteration can write its own iteration file/delta/state record (read-only would fail the post-dispatch artifact gate); -c approval_policy=never keeps it non-interactive; --model omitted when unset so ~/.codex/config.toml default applies\"\n8:1665-          command: |\n20:1677-            // without this they silently degrade to native. The command builder is the\n21:1678-            // same one the fan-out lineage path uses, so the enforced model allowlist,\n22:1679-            // headless write-mode flags, and binary preflight stay one source of truth.\n31:1688-            // The iteration must write its own iteration file, delta and state record,\n40:1697-            const promptBody = withAgentPersona('deep-review', readFileSync('{state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md', 'utf8'), repoRoot);\n41:1698-            const { command, args, input } = buildLineageCommand(\n59:1716-            const dispatchId = 'review-i{current_iteration}-g{generation}';\n65:1971-          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type review --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n66:1972-          command_note: \"Mechanical leaf-reliability gate: exit 0 = complete; non-zero prints one machine reason (dispatch_failed|iteration_file_missing|iteration_verdict_missing|state_record_missing|route_proof_missing|route_proof_mismatch|delta_file_missing). dispatch_failed means the narrative is missing and the completion receipt shows a non-zero exit or a signal. The script enforces the artifact + route-proof contract instead of trusting the leaf to self-report, and a non-zero exit triggers on_failure.redispatch_once.\"\n67:1973-          assert_exists: \"{state_paths.iteration_pattern}\"\n69:1975-          assert_jsonl_fields: [type, iteration, mode, run, status, focus, dimensions, filesReviewed, findingsCount, findingsSummary, findingsNew, findingDetails, newFindingsRatio, sessionId, generation, lineageMode, timestamp, durationMs]\n77:1983-            dispatchId: \"review-i{current_iteration}-g{generation}\"\n78:1984-          assert_canonical_type: \"iteration\"\n79:1985-          assert_delta_file_exists: \"{state_paths.delta_pattern}\"\n80:1986-          assert_delta_file_has_iteration_record: true\n82:1988-            - iteration_file_missing\n83:1989-            - iteration_file_empty\n88:1994-            - delta_file_missing\n89:1995-            - delta_file_empty\n90:1996-            - delta_file_missing_iteration_record\n97:2003-            - delta_iteration_id_mismatch\n98:2004-            - state_delta_iteration_mismatch\n105:2011-            event_shape: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"schema_advisory\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"iteration\":{current_iteration},\"warnings\":{result.warnings},\"severity\":\"advisory\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n106:2012-            note: \"Warnings do not fail dispatch. Hard failures still emit schema_mismatch through on_failure.\"\n108:2014-            action: \"emit schema_mismatch canonical conflict event\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1:1658:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n2:1659-            - \"Nested CLI dispatch from a lineage is a route violation, not a slow path: a codex lineage that runs this script spawns codex inside its own sandbox, where the child cannot initialize and every iteration fails. The script refuses that case before any spawn and before any dispatch receipt is written, exiting RECURSION_GUARD_EXIT_CODE; that refusal is a route error to fix, never a redispatchable executor failure.\"\n5:1662-            - \"codex exec reads the iteration prompt from stdin via the trailing '-' (input: promptBody); '-c model_reasoning_effort=' maps reasoning depth, default medium; '-c service_tier=' forwarded when configured\"\n6:1663-            - \"--sandbox workspace-write is required so the iteration can write its own iteration file/delta/state record (read-only would fail the post-dispatch artifact gate); -c approval_policy=never keeps it non-interactive; --model omitted when unset so ~/.codex/config.toml default applies\"\n8:1665-          command: |\n20:1677-            // without this they silently degrade to native. The command builder is the\n21:1678-            // same one the fan-out lineage path uses, so the enforced model allowlist,\n22:1679-            // headless write-mode flags, and binary preflight stay one source of truth.\n31:1688-            // The iteration must write its own iteration file, delta and state record,\n40:1697-            const promptBody = withAgentPersona('deep-review', readFileSync('{state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md', 'utf8'), repoRoot);\n41:1698-            const { command, args, input } = buildLineageCommand(\n59:1716-            const dispatchId = 'review-i{current_iteration}-g{generation}';\n65:1971-          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type review --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n66:1972-          command_note: \"Mechanical leaf-reliability gate: exit 0 = complete; non-zero prints one machine reason (dispatch_failed|iteration_file_missing|iteration_verdict_missing|state_record_missing|route_proof_missing|route_proof_mismatch|delta_file_missing). dispatch_failed means the narrative is missing and the completion receipt shows a non-zero exit or a signal. The script enforces the artifact + route-proof contract instead of trusting the leaf to self-report, and a non-zero exit triggers on_failure.redispatch_once.\"\n67:1973-          assert_exists: \"{state_paths.iteration_pattern}\"\n69:1975-          assert_jsonl_fields: [type, iteration, mode, run, status, focus, dimensions, filesReviewed, findingsCount, findingsSummary, findingsNew, findingDetails, newFindingsRatio, sessionId, generation, lineageMode, timestamp, durationMs]\n77:1983-            dispatchId: \"review-i{current_iteration}-g{generation}\"\n78:1984-          assert_canonical_type: \"iteration\"\n79:1985-          assert_delta_file_exists: \"{state_paths.delta_pattern}\"\n80:1986-          assert_delta_file_has_iteration_record: true\n82:1988-            - iteration_file_missing\n83:1989-            - iteration_file_empty\n88:1994-            - delta_file_missing\n89:1995-            - delta_file_empty\n90:1996-            - delta_file_missing_iteration_record\n97:2003-            - delta_iteration_id_mismatch\n98:2004-            - state_delta_iteration_mismatch\n105:2011-            event_shape: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"schema_advisory\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"iteration\":{current_iteration},\"warnings\":{result.warnings},\"severity\":\"advisory\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n106:2012-            note: \"Warnings do not fail dispatch. Hard failures still emit schema_mismatch through on_failure.\"\n108:2014-            action: \"emit schema_mismatch canonical conflict event\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \\\"post_dispatch_validate\\\" -A 60 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | rg -n \\\"exactly|one|delta|iteration|schema_mismatch|command\\\" | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1794595867719,"end":1794595868473}}}}
