{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794595899660,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d64042b60017l267IZF8Xu5ga","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d63fd354001Y55E9ejqlH1eGa","type":"tool","id":"call_6858f1de95824636861147be","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \"maxIterationsReached|stopReason|reason:\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | sed -n '1,40p'"},"output":"724:            pending_stop_reason: \"userPaused\"\n777:               stopReason = \"blockedStop\"\n782:             a) if iteration_count >= max_iterations: set decision = \"STOP\", stopReason = \"maxIterationsReached\", hard_stop_reason = \"max_iterations_reached\", preserve any failed legal-stop gates as terminal evidence, and proceed to synthesis without legal-stop veto\n785:             Operator stop reasons (`maxIterationsReached`, `manualStop`, `userPaused`, unrecoverable `error`) are terminal ceilings. They do not hide failed gates; they record them in synthesis and stop dispatch.\n820:               stopReason = \"blockedStop\"\n852:                    stopReason = \"blockedStop\"\n868:          - reason: \"Human-readable stop reason\"\n894:          - graphless_fallback_unavailability_reason: \"Explicit unavailability reason when graphCoverageMode == unavailable_blocked\"\n920:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused]\n1124:            pending_stop_reason: \"stuckRecovery\"\n1131:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused\"\n1137:            pending_stop_reason: null\n1144:            pending_stop_reason: null\n2050:            set: { reason: \"error\", stopReason: \"error\" }\n2260:    