consumes the shared predicate at `command-attach.ts:335`; no gate drift |\n | `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no runtime mirror in this diff |\n-| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n+| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | partial | 3 | catalog row promises a reader who rules out a change is never handed work that writes; contradicted for the object-bearing class by P1-001 |\n | `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no playbook surface in this diff |\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | partial | 3 | catalog row promises a reader who rules out a change is never handed work that writes; contradicted for the object-bearing class by P1-001 |\",\"oldString\":\"| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794596033990,"end":1794596037216}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794596037221,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d642597a001xODXHsOMZabgjf","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d64244360019e5dGT8YXiuNbd","type":"tool","id":"call_089fd0dc6f0c4f89b7244194","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- \"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).\n- \"The packet's acceptance rows are falsely marked Met\": AC-001 is scoped to requests ending in a no-edit phrase and AC-027 to the seven wrapper launches; both still pass, so what is missing is a row, not a false claim (iteration 3).\n- \"Doc drift in the feature catalog\": both catalog rows describe the predicate mechanism correctly; the contradiction is behavioural (P1-001), not stale wording (iteration 3).","oldString":"- \"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -152,8 +152,10 @@\n - \"The `/^-[rC]/` early return hides a real no-run short flag\": `-r`/`-C` consume the rest of the word as a value, so a later letter is a value, not a flag (iteration 1, evidence: `node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option: -rc`).\n - \"The no-edit fix breaks the case it targeted\": both commit-added rows and `make no changes to its public api` return `false` (iteration 2, evidence: `command-attach.ts:289` and the predicate run in `iterations/iteration-002.md`).\n - \"Another alternative in `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` catches `make no changes to any file, just report what you find`\": all nine alternatives were enumerated against the prompt and none match (iteration 2).\n - \"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).\n+- \"The packet's acceptance rows are falsely marked Met\": AC-001 is scoped to requests ending in a no-edit phrase and AC-027 to the seven wrapper launches; both still pass, so what is missing is a row, not a false claim (iteration 3).\n+- \"Doc drift in the feature catalog\": both catalog rows describe the predicate mechanism correctly; the contradiction is behavioural (P1-001), not stale wording (iteration 3).\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n - Dimension: none remaining (correctness, maintainability, traceability covered; security has no surface in this diff)\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- \\\"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\\\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).\\n- \\\"The packet's acceptance rows are falsely marked Met\\\": AC-001 is scoped to requests ending in a no-edit phrase and AC-027 to the seven wrapper launches; both still pass, so what is missing is a row, not a false claim (iteration 3).\\n- \\\"Doc drift in the feature catalog\\\": both catalog rows describe the predicate mechanism correctly; the contradiction is behavioural (P1-001), not stale wording (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- \\\"A caller compensates for the predicate change with a second check\\\": `attachCommand`, `readOnlyRouteAllowed`, `commandMeaningEligible` and `isReadOnlyExplainer` all delegate to the predicate and add no object or verb check (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794596034939,"end":1794596037221}}}}
