{"type":"text","timestamp":1794596287940,"sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","part":{"id":"prt_1d6462459002DRO8OF26ZKDLmp","sessionID":"ses_e29cd1063ffeCxGmp1qmJeHmTZ","messageID":"msg_1d645f006001V0j9UZW0nrnE6a","type":"text","text":"Synthesis is complete and all lineage artifacts reconcile.\n\n**Result — hook-confirm-3b**\n\n| Iteration | Focus | New P0/P1/P2 | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Hook check driver (deepest) | 0/0/1 | PASS |\n| 2 | No-edit predicate + callers | 0/1/1 | CONDITIONAL |\n| 3 | Test tables + traceability | 0/0/2 | CONDITIONAL |\n\n**The two fixes:**\n- **Doctor hook check — holds.** `node -e1`, `node --eval=1`, `node --print=1`, `node -pe 1` and `node -ci` now report `hook-missing`; eight working-launch shapes (`-r./preload.cjs`, `-r ./preload.cjs`, `-i`, `-C development`, `--`, `--inspect-brk`, `--no-warnings`, plain) still report `ok`. No regression introduced. One pre-existing P2 false-`ok` (`node - <marker>`, `node -rc <marker>`).\n- **No-edit pattern — does not hold cleanly.** It fixes `make no changes to its public api` and `make no changes in the tests`, but introduces **P1 HC3B-P1-001**: `make no changes to any file, just report what you find` now returns `false` and `attachCommand` offers `/create:agent` — the pre-commit module returned `true`/`undefined` for the same prompt (proven by running both modules). A P2 remains for `make no changes whatsoever to ...`.\n\nActive findings: 0 P0, 1 P1, 3 P2 + 1 P2 pre-existing = 5 open. Release readiness: `in-progress`; stop reason `maxIterationsReached` (ratio 0.22 > 0.10 at the cap).\n\nVerification: gateway exit 0 for run-open + 3 iterations + synthesis (receipted ledger); `verify-iteration.cjs` OK for iterations 1–3; deltas match state rows; both permitted suites green (32/32 hook, 26/26 guards); review targets unmodified; all writes inside `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-confirm-3b`.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:hook-confirm-3b","time":{"start":1794596283481,"end":1794596287940}}}
